usage: rebis.sidechain [-h] [--batch] [--list] [--info] [--json] [--pdb PDB]
                       [--cutoff CUTOFF] [--verbose] [--file FILE] [--stdin]
                       [sidechain] [environment]

Sidechain × Environment Compositional Algebra

positional arguments:
  sidechain             Sidechain name
  environment           Environment name

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --batch               Analyze all 80 pairs
  --list                List all sidechains and environments
  --info                Show module info
  --json                Output analysis as JSON (single pair, --batch, or
                        --pdb)
  --pdb PDB             Analyze a real PDB structure (ID or file path)
  --cutoff CUTOFF       Neighbor cutoff in Å for environment classification
                        (default: 8.0)
  --verbose             Per-residue output for PDB analysis
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
